.TH ALIAS-SUGGEST 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
alias-suggest \- Scan command history for repeated long commands and suggest zsh aliases.
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBalias-suggest --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: alias-suggest [--limit N] [--min-count N] [--min-len N] [--dry-run] [--help]

Scan command history for repeated long commands and suggest zsh aliases.
Output is formatted for direct inclusion in aliases.zsh.

Options:
  --limit N       History entries to scan (default: 1000)
  --min-count N   Minimum repetitions to qualify (default: 3)
  --min-len N     Minimum command length to qualify (default: 30)
  --dry-run       Print raw candidates (count + command) without AI inference
  --help          Show this message
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
